{"id":10161,"name":"meowth-galar","speciesId":52,"dex":52,"form":"galarian","generation":1,"types":["steel"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":65,"defense":55,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":40,"speed":40},"abilities":[{"name":"pickup","hidden":false},{"name":"tough-claws","hidden":false},{"name":"unnerve","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":75,"baseExp":58,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10161.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10161.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10161.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10161.ogg","genus":"Scratch Cat Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"shield","text":"It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth."},{"version":"red","text":"Adores circular objects. Wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can't stop from picking them up."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is fascinated by round objects. It can't stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep."},{"version":"silver","text":"It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and se­ cretly hoards."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It loves things that sparkle. When it sees a shiny object, the gold coin on its head shines too."},{"version":"ruby","text":"MEOWTH withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"version":"emerald","text":"MEOWTH withdraw their sharp claws into their paws to silently sneak about. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"version":"firered","text":"All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Adores round objects. It wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It is fascinated by round objects. It can’t stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and secretly hoards."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Meowth withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this Pokémon loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"version":"sun","text":"It lies around all day, becoming active near dusk. At night, it wanders the city in search of loose change."},{"version":"moon","text":"It loves shiny things. It often fights with Murkrow over prey they’re both trying to catch."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"When visiting a junkyard, you may catch sight of it having an intense fight with Murkrow over shiny objects."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It loves coins, so if you give it one, you can make friends with Meowth easily. But it’s fickle, so you can’t count on that friendship lasting."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can’t stop itself from picking them up."},{"version":"sword","text":"It loves to collect shiny things. If it’s in a good mood, it might even let its Trainer have a look at its hoard of treasures."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":255,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"meowth","speciesId":52,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28","Felicidade alta"],"species":"persian","speciesId":53,"evolve